<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimate Tuesday's hog slaughter from 355,000 to 367,000 head versus 349,000 a week ago and 354,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 128,000 to 132,000 head against 123,000 a week ago and 128,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
